Hi all,

The integration tests for the v2 endpoints are all green now.
Here's the coverage summary:

  Module                  | Coverage | Tests
  ------------------------|----------|------
  users.controller        | 94%      | 47
  users.service           | 91%      | 38
  search.controller       | 88%      | 31
  search.service          | 85%      | 29
  bulk.processor          | 92%      | 22
  auth.middleware          | 96%      | 15
  rate-limiter            | 89%      | 12
  error-handler           | 93%      | 18
  Total                   | 91%      | 212

I also added contract tests against the OpenAPI spec. Any drift between
the implementation and the spec will fail the CI pipeline.

One concern: the bulk processor tests are flaky when run in parallel
because they share a database. I'm going to switch them to use
isolated transactions. Should be fixed by Monday.

- Carol

